PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "So. You've made it past BLUE.\p"
    .string "Good.\p"
    .string "Young TRAINERS are always in such\n"
    .string "a hurry.\p"
    .string "Hit harder.\p"
    .string "Move faster.\p"
    .string "Finish the battle before the other\n"
    .string "fellow can think.\p"
    .string "Hmph.\p"
    .string "There are subtler ways to win.\p"
    .string "A drop here.\p"
    .string "A little pressure there.\p"
    .string "Given enough time...\p"
    .string "even the strongest POKéMON begins\n"
    .string "to weaken.\p"
    .string "I am AGATHA of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    .string "Come, child.\p"
    .string "Let me teach you a little patience.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back again?\p"
    .string "Heh.\p"
    .string "Good.\p"
    .string "You already know how poison works.\p"
    .string "You know what happens when pressure\n"
    .string "is allowed to build.\p"
    .string "Which means this time...\p"
    .string "I don't have the luxury of waiting\n"
    .string "for you to learn the lesson.\p"
    .string "Let's see how patient the CHAMPION\n"
    .string "really is.{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "...Heh.\p"
    .string "Very good.\p"
    .string "You didn't panic.\p"
    .string "Most TRAINERS do, once they realize\n"
    .string "the battle is slipping away from\l"
    .string "them.\p"
    .string "Poison works slowly.\p"
    .string "Fear works faster.\p"
    .string "You gave me neither advantage.$"

PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_RematchDefeat::
    .string "Still calm.\p"
    .string "Still watching.\p"
    .string "Still refusing to give me the\n"
    .string "opening I want.\p"
    .string "Very good.\p"
    .string "That's why you're wearing the title.$"

PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Go on.\p"
    .string "LANCE is waiting for you.\p"
    .string "But remember what you learned here.\p"
    .string "Strength isn't always loud.\p"
    .string "Sometimes...\p"
    .string "one little drop is enough.$"

PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_RematchPostBattle::
    .string "Move along.\p"
    .string "LANCE has probably been taking\n"
    .string "notes since the moment you entered\l"
    .string "the building.\p"
    .string "I imagine he has several pages by\n"
    .string "now.$"
